<div class="configurator" data-configurator>
  <script type="application/json" data-pricing-data>{{ pricing | jsonLd | safe }}</script>
  <div class="config-step config-base">
    <p class="eyebrow">01 / FIND YOUR STARTING POINT</p>
    <h3>Start with what your work needs.</h3>
    <p class="config-intro">Explore the stages from a scoped recommendation to a resilient production platform. Each is a separate engagement, not a required upgrade path. Service fees in USD.</p>
    <div data-slider-controls hidden>
      <label class="eyebrow" for="engagement">ENGAGEMENT & COMPLEXITY</label>
      <input id="engagement" type="range" min="0" max="3" step="1" value="1" aria-describedby="stage-help" />
      <div class="stage-buttons">
        {% for stage in pricing.stages %}<button type="button" data-stage-button aria-pressed="false">{{ stage.short }}</button>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="micro" id="stage-help">Drag, use the arrow keys, or choose a stage below the slider.</p>
    </div>
    {% for stage in pricing.stages %}
    <article class="stage-panel" data-stage-panel>
      <div class="stage-summary"><div><p class="eyebrow">{{ stage.best }}</p><h4>{{ stage.name }}</h4></div><p class="stage-price">{{ stage | priceRange }}</p></div>
      <p>{{ stage.text }}</p>
      <ul>{% for feature in stage.features %}<li>{{ feature }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      <p class="scope-callout">{{ stage.callout }}</p>
      {% if stage.assessment %}<p class="micro">Plus a required assessment: {{ stage.assessment | priceRange }}. Included in the total below; fees are separate unless expressly bundled or credited in your proposal.</p>{% endif %}
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="config-step" id="options">
    <p class="eyebrow">02 / TAILOR THE INSTALL</p>
    <h3>Specialist work. Your selection.</h3>
    <p class="config-intro">Add complexity where you need it. Delivery, security, monitoring and applicable tested recovery are already part of a production launch.</p>
    <p class="scope-callout" data-assessment-note hidden>Assessment is a standalone recommendation. Choose a pilot or launch to estimate installation add-ons and post-handoff support.</p>
    <fieldset class="config-choices" data-addon-fields>
      <legend class="sr-only">Specialist add-ons</legend>
      {% for addon in pricing.addons %}
      <label class="config-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="addon" value="{{ loop.index0 }}" /><span><strong>{{ addon.name }}</strong><span class="choice-price">{{ addon | priceRange }}</span><span>{{ addon.text }}</span></span></label>
      {% endfor %}
    </fieldset>
  </div>
  <div class="config-step">
    <p class="eyebrow">03 / PLAN FOR AFTER HANDOFF</p>
    <h3>A little help, when you need it.</h3>
    <p class="config-intro">Support is optional with a qualified operator. No default 12-month commitment. Every production quote includes a defined stabilization period; care does not bill again for that same work.</p>
    <fieldset class="config-choices support-choices" data-support-fields>
      <legend class="sr-only">Post-handoff support</legend>
      {% for plan in pricing.support %}
      <label class="config-choice"><input type="radio" name="support" value="{{ loop.index0 }}" {% if loop.first %}checked{% endif %} /><span><strong>{{ plan.name }}</strong><span class="choice-price">{{ plan | priceRange }} / month</span><span>{{ plan.text }}</span></span></label>
      {% endfor %}
    </fieldset>
    <p class="support-note">Business-hours communication. Routine covered requests receive a best-effort response within two business days. No 24/7 on-call, guaranteed restoration, service credits or formal SLA. Your operator or MSP owns incident response. Complex or multiple environments require a custom care quote; capacity, cadence, overages and cancellation terms are agreed in writing.</p>
  </div>
  <section class="config-total" data-total hidden aria-labelledby="estimate-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">04 / YOUR ESTIMATED TOTAL</p>
    <h3 id="estimate-title">A starting point for the conversation.</h3>
    <div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
      <div class="total-figures"><div><span>Estimated project service fees</span><strong data-project-total></strong></div><div><span>Optional post-handoff support</span><strong data-monthly-total></strong><span data-support-total></span></div></div>
      <div class="estimate-breakdown"><p data-base-total></p><p data-assessment-total></p><p data-extras-total></p><p data-quote-note></p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="micro">An indicative estimate, not a fixed quote. “From” and “+” prices have no fixed upper limit. Hardware, licenses, cloud services, travel, shipping and taxes are extra. Monthly support is separate from project fees.</p>
    {{ booking('button button-dark') }}
  </section>
  <noscript><p class="scope-callout">All engagement and support prices are listed above. Enable JavaScript for an interactive estimate, or book a consultation to scope your project.</p></noscript>
</div>
